      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → BytePlus → BytePlus Settings**.\n2. Describe the series in **Brief**, starting with how many, such as \"Generate 4 posters\".\n3. Press **Run**. Up to four posters are saved under `image/byteplus`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
