      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Model** holds the model **Series** uses. **Model: Info** shows what the extension knows about it, for free and without the key, and **Info** shows it as JSON. Seedream 4.0 makes several related images in one request, so `max_images` can be 4. The default, Seedream 5.0 flash, makes one image per request, so the node refuses 4 for it before sending anything."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
